{"id": "cbs_grumbnar_smash_0142c9", "featureId": "grumbnar_smash", "observed": "fails", "errorClass": "selector-colon", "errorNeedle": "Unexpected COLON symbol \":\"", "previously": null, "reconciled": null, "sourceSha": "0142c9be4444", "source": "import common\n\n# Grumbnar the Troll is the wish_mob creature (currently the only custom species).\ndefine @Grumbnar = @e[type=moddingfromamod:wish_mob]\nend\n\n# Distance bands: closer players get a stronger, longer camera shake.\nfunction mark3()\n    @s.gs_pow = 3\n    @s.gs_shake = 14\nend\nfunction mark2()\n    @s.gs_pow = 2\n    @s.gs_shake = 10\nend\nfunction mark1()\n    @s.gs_pow = 1\n    @s.gs_shake = 7\nend\n\nreset\n    /scoreboard objectives add gs_t dummy\n    /scoreboard objectives add gs_shake dummy\n    /scoreboard objectives add gs_pow dummy\n    /scoreboard objectives add gs_ph dummy\n    /scoreboard objectives add gs_par dummy\nend\n\nclock tick\n    # Every Grumbnar smashes the ground every 300 ticks (15s), aggro or not.\n    as @Grumbnar\n        @s.gs_t = @s.gs_t + 1\n        if @s.gs_t >= 300\n            @s.gs_t = 0\n            at @s\n                /playsound minecraft:entity.iron_golem.attack block @a ~ ~ ~ 4 0.5\n                /playsound minecraft:entity.generic.explode block @a ~ ~ ~ 3 0.6\n                /particle minecraft:explosion ~ ~0.2 ~ 1.0 0.1 1.0 0.0 6 force\n                /particle minecraft:block minecraft:dirt ~ ~0.2 ~ 2.0 0.2 2.0 0.3 150 force\n                as @a[distance=..4]\n                    mark3()\n                end\n                as @a[distance=4..8]\n                    mark2()\n                end\n                as @a[distance=8..14]\n                    mark1()\n                end\n            end\n        end\n    end\n\n    # Apply the shake: jitter the view left/right + up/down each tick while it lasts.\n    as @a[scores={gs_shake=1..}]\n        @s.gs_shake = @s.gs_shake - 1\n        @s.gs_ph = @s.gs_ph + 1\n        @s.gs_par = @s.gs_ph % 2\n        if @s.gs_pow >= 3\n            if @s.gs_par == 0\n                /tp @s ~ ~ ~ ~5 ~3\n            else\n                /tp @s ~ ~ ~ ~-5 ~-3\n            end\n        else if @s.gs_pow == 2\n            if @s.gs_par == 0\n                /tp @s ~ ~ ~ ~3 ~1\n            else\n                /tp @s ~ ~ ~ ~-3 ~-1\n            end\n        else\n            if @s.gs_par == 0\n                /tp @s ~ ~ ~ ~1 ~1\n            else\n                /tp @s ~ ~ ~ ~-1 ~-1\n            end\n        end\n    end\nend\n"}
