{"id": "cbs_bowser_fire_breath_7d282c", "featureId": "bowser_fire_breath", "observed": "compiles", "errorClass": null, "errorNeedle": null, "previously": null, "reconciled": null, "sourceSha": "7d282c820382", "source": "import common\n\nreset\n    /scoreboard objectives add bwfire dummy\n    /scoreboard objectives add bwblast dummy\nend\n\nfunction arm()\n    /tag @s add bwf\n    /scoreboard players set @s bwblast 0\n    /execute store result score @s bwfire run random value 40..90\nend\n\nfunction start()\n    /execute store result score @s bwfire run random value 300..600\n    /scoreboard players set @s bwblast 30\n    /execute at @s run playsound minecraft:entity_ender_dragon_growl hostile @a ~ ~ ~ 5 0.6\n    /execute at @s run playsound minecraft:entity_ghast_shoot hostile @a ~ ~ ~ 5 0.5\nend\n\nfunction scorch()\n    /execute rotated as @s rotated ~ 0 positioned ^0 ^4 ^3 as @e[distance=..4,type=!minecraft:item,type=!minecraft:item_display,type=!minecraft:block_display,type=!minecraft:text_display,type=!minecraft:interaction,type=!minecraft:armor_stand,type=!moddingfromamod:wish_mob] run damage @s 4 minecraft:on_fire\n    /execute rotated as @s rotated ~ 0 positioned ^0 ^4 ^7 as @e[distance=..4,type=!minecraft:item,type=!minecraft:item_display,type=!minecraft:block_display,type=!minecraft:text_display,type=!minecraft:interaction,type=!minecraft:armor_stand,type=!moddingfromamod:wish_mob] run damage @s 4 minecraft:on_fire\nend\n\nfunction breathe()\n    /execute rotated as @s rotated ~ 0 positioned ^0 ^4 ^1 run particle minecraft:flame ~ ~ ~ 0.3 0.3 0.3 0.02 25 force\n    /execute rotated as @s rotated ~ 0 positioned ^0 ^4 ^3 run particle minecraft:flame ~ ~ ~ 0.7 0.7 0.7 0.03 35 force\n    /execute rotated as @s rotated ~ 0 positioned ^0 ^4 ^3 run particle minecraft:lava ~ ~ ~ 0.6 0.6 0.6 0.0 3 force\n    /execute rotated as @s rotated ~ 0 positioned ^0 ^4 ^6 run particle minecraft:flame ~ ~ ~ 1.1 1.1 1.1 0.04 45 force\n    /execute rotated as @s rotated ~ 0 pos