{"id": "cbs_eggbomb_67a015", "featureId": "eggbomb", "observed": "compiles", "errorClass": null, "errorNeedle": null, "previously": null, "reconciled": null, "sourceSha": "67a015d538fd", "source": "import common\n\ndefine @EggBomb = @e[type=egg, tag=eb]\nend\n\nfunction give()\n    /give @s minecraft:egg[minecraft:custom_name='{\"text\":\"Egg Bomb\",\"color\":\"gold\",\"italic\":false}',minecraft:custom_data={eggbomb:1b},minecraft:enchantment_glint_override=true] 64\nend\n\nfunction greet()\n    /tellraw @s [\"\",{\"text\":\"\ud83e\udd5a EGG BOMBS! \",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"Throw them at Bowser! \",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\"[Click for more]\",\"color\":\"green\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"run_command\",\"value\":\"/function eggbomb:give\"}}]\nend\n\nclock tick\n    as @a[tag=!eggbomb_greeted]\n        /tag @s add eggbomb_greeted\n        greet()\n    end\n    /execute as @e[type=egg,tag=!eb,nbt={Item:{components:{\"minecraft:custom_data\":{eggbomb:1b}}}}] run tag @s add eb\n    as @EggBomb at @s\n        /particle minecraft:flame ~ ~ ~ 0.12 0.12 0.12 0.01 8 force\n        /particle minecraft:happy_villager ~ ~ ~ 0.12 0.12 0.12 0.01 4 force\n        /execute if entity @e[distance=..3.2,type=!minecraft:egg,type=!minecraft:item,type=!minecraft:player,type=!minecraft:experience_orb,type=!minecraft:arrow] run particle minecraft:explosion_emitter ~ ~ ~ 0.0 0.0 0.0 0.0 1 force\n        /execute if entity @e[distance=..3.2,type=!minecraft:egg,type=!minecraft:item,type=!minecraft:player,type=!minecraft:experience_orb,type=!minecraft:arrow] run playsound minecraft:entity.generic.explode hostile @a ~ ~ ~ 2.5 1.2\n        /execute as @e[distance=..3.2,type=!minecraft:egg,type=!minecraft:item,type=!minecraft:player,type=!minecraft:experience_orb,type=!minecraft:arrow] run damage @s 30 minecraft:magic\n    end\nend\n"}
