{"id": "cbs_stalker_enderman_b1f834", "featureId": "stalker_enderman", "observed": "compiles", "errorClass": null, "errorNeedle": null, "previously": null, "reconciled": null, "sourceSha": "b1f8345b9e01", "source": "import common\n\ndefine @Stalkers = @e[tag=stalker]\nend\n\nfunction spawn()\n    /execute at @p rotated as @p run summon minecraft:enderman ^ ^ ^-4 {Tags:[\"stalker\"],PersistenceRequired:1b,Glowing:1b,CustomNameVisible:1b,CustomName:'{\"text\":\"The Stalker\",\"color\":\"dark_purple\"}'}\n    /playsound minecraft:entity.enderman.scream master @a ~ ~ ~ 1.5 0.8\n    /tellraw @a {\"text\":\"Something just appeared behind you... \ud83d\udc9c\",\"color\":\"dark_purple\"}\nend\n\nfunction stalk_now()\n    stalkclock = 0\n    as @Stalkers at @s\n        /particle minecraft:portal ~ ~1 ~ 0.6 1.2 0.6 0.4 150 force\n        /playsound minecraft:entity.enderman.teleport master @a ~ ~ ~ 1.4 0.7\n    end\n    /execute as @e[tag=stalker] at @p rotated as @p run tp @s ^ ^ ^-4\n    as @Stalkers at @s\n        /tp @s ~ ~ ~ facing entity @p eyes\n        /particle minecraft:portal ~ ~1 ~ 0.7 1.3 0.7 0.4 200 force\n        /particle minecraft:reverse_portal ~ ~2 ~ 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.2 60 force\n        /playsound minecraft:entity.enderman.stare master @a ~ ~ ~ 1.0 0.9\n        /effect give @a[distance=..24] minecraft:blindness 2 0\n        /effect give @s minecraft:regeneration 12 2 true\n    end\nend\n\nreset\n    stalkclock = 0\nend\n\nclock tick\n    stalkclock = stalkclock + 1\n    as @Stalkers at @s\n        /particle minecraft:portal ~ ~1 ~ 0.4 1.0 0.4 0.1 6 force\n    end\n    if stalkclock > 119\n        stalk_now()\n    end\nend\n"}
