{"id": "cbs_crystal_golem_power_5c37b5", "featureId": "crystal_golem_power", "observed": "compiles", "errorClass": null, "errorNeedle": null, "previously": null, "reconciled": null, "sourceSha": "5c37b5d528af", "source": "import common\n\ndefine @Golems = @e[tag=wishmob_crystal_golem]\nend\n\nfunction golem_tick()\n    /particle minecraft:witch ~ ~2 ~ 1.2 2.0 1.2 0.0 6 force\n    /particle minecraft:end_rod ~ ~3 ~ 1.0 1.5 1.0 0.01 3 force\n    /execute unless entity @e[tag=cg_track,distance=..2] run summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:[\"cg_track\"]}\n    /execute as @e[tag=cg_track,distance=..4,limit=1,sort=nearest] run tp @s ~ ~ ~\nend\n\nfunction stomp()\n    stompclock = 0\n    /execute as @e[tag=wishmob_crystal_golem] at @s if entity @a[distance=..5] run particle minecraft:explosion ~ ~ ~ 2.5 0.2 2.5 0.0 12 force\n    /execute as @e[tag=wishmob_crystal_golem] at @s if entity @a[distance=..5] run particle minecraft:crit ~ ~ ~ 3 0.3 3 0.4 120 force\n    /execute as @e[tag=wishmob_crystal_golem] at @s if entity @a[distance=..5] run playsound minecraft:block.amethyst_block.break master @a ~ ~ ~ 2.0 0.5\n    /execute as @e[tag=wishmob_crystal_golem] at @s if entity @a[distance=..5] run playsound minecraft:entity.iron_golem.attack master @a ~ ~ ~ 2.0 0.5\n    /execute as @e[tag=wishmob_crystal_golem] at @s run execute as @a[distance=..5] run damage @s 3 minecraft:generic\nend\n\nfunction shatter()\n    /particle minecraft:witch ~ ~1 ~ 2 2 2 0.3 400 force\n    /particle minecraft:end_rod ~ ~1 ~ 2 2 2 0.25 200 force\n    /particle minecraft:explosion_emitter ~ ~1 ~ 0 0 0 0 1 force\n    /playsound minecraft:block.amethyst_cluster.break master @a ~ ~ ~ 2.0 0.6\n    /playsound minecraft:block.amethyst_block.chime master @a ~ ~ ~ 2.0 0.8\n    /summon minecraft:item ~ ~1 ~ {Item:{id:\"minecraft:amethyst_shard\",count:24}}\n    /summon minecraft:item ~ ~1 ~ {Item:{id:\"minecraft:amethyst_block\",count:8}}\n    /kill @s\nend\n\nreset\n    stompclock = 0\nend\n\nclock tick\n    stompclock = stompclock + 1\n    as @Golems at @s\n        golem_tick()\n    end\n    /execute as @e[tag=cg_track] at @s unless entity @e[tag=wishmob_crystal_golem,distance=..3] run function crystal_golem_power:shatter\n    if stompclock > 19\n        stomp()\n    end\nend\n"}
{"id": "cbs_baby_ender_dragon_7be8ad", "featureId": "baby_ender_dragon", "observed": "compiles", "errorClass": null, "errorNeedle": null, "previously": null, "reconciled": null, "sourceSha": "7be8addee141", "source": "import common\n\ndefine @Babies = @e[tag=babydragon]\nend\n\nfunction spawn()\n    /execute at @p run summon minecraft:ender_dragon ~2 ~1 ~2 {Tags:[\"babydragon\"],NoAI:1b,Silent:0b,PersistenceRequired:1b,CustomNameVisible:1b,CustomName:'{\"text\":\"Baby Ender Dragon\",\"color\":\"light_purple\"}',Health:60f,attributes:[{id:\"minecraft:max_health\",base:60},{id:\"minecraft:scale\",base:0.35}]}\n    /playsound minecraft:entity.ender_dragon.growl master @a ~ ~ ~ 0.8 2.0\n    /tellraw @a {\"text\":\"A baby ender dragon hatched! It is too small to fly. \ud83d\udc09\",\"color\":\"light_purple\"}\nend\n\nfunction hop()\n    hopclock = 0\n    as @Babies at @s\n        /tp @s ~ ~1 ~\n        /particle minecraft:portal ~ ~0.4 ~ 0.4 0.2 0.4 0.3 40 force\n        /playsound minecraft:entity.ender_dragon.flap master @a ~ ~ ~ 0.7 2.0\n        /playsound minecraft:entity.ender_dragon.hurt master @a ~ ~ ~ 0.4 2.0\n    end\nend\n\nfunction baby_tick()\n    /particle minecraft:portal ~ ~0.5 ~ 0.3 0.3 0.3 0.05 3 force\n    /execute unless entity @p[distance=..3] facing entity @p feet run tp @s ^ ^ ^0.14\n    /execute at @s facing entity @p feet run tp @s ~ ~ ~ facing entity @p feet\n    /execute at @s unless block ~ ~ ~ #minecraft:replaceable run tp @s ~ ~0.5 ~\n    /execute at @s if block ~ ~-0.3 ~ #minecraft:replaceable run tp @s ~ ~-0.25 ~\nend\n\nreset\n    hopclock = 0\nend\n\nclock tick\n    hopclock = hopclock + 1\n    as @Babies at @s\n        baby_tick()\n    end\n    if hopclock > 99\n        hop()\n    end\nend\n"}
